# One whole sentence for each count, never a word slotted in.
unlock_replace_passkey_one = Setha ukhiye wokungena kuleli khompyutha bese ukhohlwa onye olondolozwe kwelinye ikhompyutha?\n\nI-Windows izokucela uqinisekise nge-Hello. Ukhiye wokungena omdala osele kwelinye ikhompyutha awuthintwa lapho futhi uzoqhubeka usebenza uma ubuyisela le folda lapho, kodwa kuzodingeka usethwe futhi.
unlock_replace_passkey_many = Setha ukhiye wokungena kuleli khompyutha bese ukhohlwa abangu-{count} abalondolozwe kwamanye amakhompyutha?\n\nI-Windows izokucela uqinisekise nge-Hello. Okhiye bokungena abadala abasele kwelinye ikhompyutha abathintwa lapho futhi bazoqhubeka basebenza uma ubuyisela le folda lapho, kodwa kuzodingeka basethwe futhi.
unlock_method_works = Leyo ndlela iyasebenza.

plain_text_password_found = I-data\config\himalaya.toml isaqukethe iphasiwedi yombhalo ovamile (auth.raw) evela ekusethweni kwe-akhawunti endala.\n\nSusa leyo akhawunti bese uyengeza futhi, noma wusule i-data\config\himalaya.toml ukuze yakhiwe kabusha isebenzisa indawo egcina izitifiketi ephephile.

