# The explanatory note under each setting. One paragraph, one key.
set_debug_note = Ukurekhoda kokususa amaphutha kusiza ukuhlonza izinkinga uma kukhona okungahambi kahle. Ukukuvala kumisa ukubhalwa kwamarekhodi amasha; amafayela amarekhodi akhona awasuswa. Kusebenza ngokuqala okulandelayo kwe-ZBox.
set_language_note = Kusebenza ngokuqala okulandelayo kwe-ZBox. Amafayela olimi angamafayela ombhalo ovamile kufolda ye-lang ye-ZBox, eduze kwefolda ye-sounds. Ukuze wengeze elilodwa, kopisha ifolda ye-en, uqambe kabusha ikhophi nefayela le-.lang elikuyo libe yikhodi yolimi lwakho, bese uhumusha umbhalo ongakwesokudla sophawu ngalunye lokulingana. Noma yini engakahunyushwa ikhulunywa ngesiNgisi kunokuthula, ngakho ifayela elingaqediwe lisebenziseka ngokuphepha.
set_headers_note = Kusuka ku-, Ku-, Cc, Usuku nesihloko, kukhonjiswa ngenhla komzimba womlayezo kuyo yomibili imibono yombhalo ne-HTML. Ngaphandle kwalokhu akukho ndlela yokwazi ukuthi ubani othumele umlayezo ngaphakathi kuwo ngaphandle kokuvala ithebhu ubuyele ohlwini. Ifokhasi isafika emzimbeni womlayezo; ibhulokhi yezihloko ingu-Shift+Tab owodwa kude. Kusebenza ngokuvulwa okulandelayo komlayezo.
set_zoom_note = Kwenza umbhalo womlayezo ovuliwe mkhulu noma mncane, ngokuzimela kwezinye izingxenye ze-ZBox nasekukhuliseni kwesikrini se-Windows. Kusebenza kuyo yomibili imibono yombhalo ne-HTML. U-"Uhlamvu lokufunda" ungaphoqa uhlamvu oluthile (isb. Consolas, OpenDyslexic) emzimbeni womlayezo; shiya lukhale ukuze kugcinwe uhlamvu lwejwayelekile. U-Ctrl+Shift+= / Ctrl+Shift+- / Ctrl+Shift+0 kumenyu ethi Buka kukhuphula, kuncisha noma kusetha kabusha usayizi wohlamvu kuphela ngaphandle kokuvula leli windi, futhi kusebenza ngokushesha kuwo wonke umlayezo ovuliwe. Izinguquko ezenziwe lapha nazo zisebenza ngokushesha ku-OK.
set_view_note = I-HTML iyona ezenzakalelayo. Ikhombisa umlayezo njengoba uthunyelwe, futhi ifundwa yi-NVDA ne-JAWS: uma ikhasi le-HTML livulwa, i-ZBox ithulisa isimemezelo sesiphequluli, ibeka ikhesa lokufunda emgqeni wokuqala womlayezo, futhi igcina izinqamuleli zayo ze-ZBox zisebenza ngaphakathi kwekhasi, kuhlanganisa ne-F6 yokuhambisa ifokhasi iphume kulo. Umbhalo ukhombisa lowo mlayezo njengombhalo ovamile ongafomethiwe enkontilweni evamile yokuhlela -- akukho zithombe, akukho ukuhlelwa, futhi akukho okuncike ekutheni injini yesiphequluli ifakiwe. Cindezela Ctrl+B ngaphakathi komlayezo ovuliwe ukushintsha nganoma iyiphi indlela.
set_engine_note = I-Edge ikhombisa i-CSS yesimanje kodwa isebenzisa ikhasi enqubweni ehlukile, futhi inikeza okuqukethwe kwayo komfundi wesikrini kuphela ngesixhumanisi i-wxPython engakwazi ukusifinyelela -- ngakho umlayezo ungavuleka ungenalutho olufundekayo. I-MSHTML endala yinjini ebisetshenziswa yi-Outlook Express ne-Windows Mail: isebenza ngaphakathi kwenqubo futhi ikhipha isihlahla sombhalo esijwayelekile, ngakho i-NVDA ne-JAWS bayifunda kumodi yokuphequlula njenganoma yiliphi ikhasi lewebhu. Kusebenza ngokuvulwa okulandelayo komlayezo.
set_runtime_note = I-runtime yesistimu yonke ilungiswa yi-Windows Update, ngakho injini efunda iposi lakho ingashintsha ngaphandle kwesexwayiso -- yilokho okungenza umbono womlayezo we-HTML osebenzayo wephuce emshinini lapho kungashintshanga lutho nge-ZBox. Ikhophi efakwe kanye kufolda ye-deps ibambelela inguqulo eqondile i-ZBox ehlolwe ngayo. Sebenzisa i-tools\get_webview2.bat ukufaka eyodwa. Uma kungekho khophi efakwe kanye, i-ZBox isebenzisa i-runtime yesistimu yonke noma kunjalo, ngakho iyaqala njalo. Kusebenza ngokuqala okulandelayo kwe-ZBox.
set_sr_intro = Ukuthi i-ZBox ivumela umfundi wakho wesikrini ukukhuluma kangakanani ngenkathi kuvulwa umlayezo, nokuthi izimemezelo zayo ezikhulunywayo zihlala isikhathi esingakanani.
set_silence_note = Uma umlayezo we-HTML uvulwa, i-ZBox ingabamba i-Ctrl yokwenziwa kuze kube yizi-2 amasekhondi ukuthulisa isimemezelo sesiphequluli somfundi wesikrini. Isihloko somlayezo sesivele sisetshenziswa njengesihloko sekhasi, okuvimbela i-URL ye-base64 ukufundwa ngokuvakashayo, kodwa umfundi usamemezela ukulawula nohlobo lwedokhumenti phezu kokuqala komlayezo, ngakho lokhu kuvuliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo. Khetha Valiwe ukukuvala, noma isikhathi esingeziwe uma umsindo usadlula.
set_focus_delay_note = Uma umlayezo we-HTML uqeda ukulayisha, i-ZBox ilinda lesi sikhathi ngaphambi kokuwufokhasa ngempela. I-WebView2 imemezela ukuthi ikhasi lilayishiwe kanye ne-Windows iqeda isihlahla sokufinyeleleka sekhasi akusona isikhathi esifanayo; ukufokhasa kusenesikhathi yilokho okwenza i-NVDA/JAWS imemezele "Web content page" evamile esikhundleni somlayezo, noma imemezele umlayezo ungatholakali isikhashana ngemva kokuvula. Izinketho zisuka ku-0.1 isekhondi kuya kwesi-1. Khetha isikhathi eside uma usakuzwa lokhu, nesifushane uma ukuvula kuzwakala kuqinile, ukuze kuvuleke ngokushesha.
set_announce_note = U-Ctrl+U no-Ctrl+Shift+U bamemezela umthumeli ewindini elincane elizivalayo, ngoba ibha yesimo ikhulunywa kuphela uma umfundi wakho wesikrini evule ukubika kwebha yesimo. Yilesi isikhathi leli windi elihlala ngaso. Lisethe ukuze lifane nesivinini sakho sokukhuluma: uma lifushane kakhulu, livala phakathi nomusho, okuhlula inhloso. Noma yikuphi ukhiye likuvala ngaphambi kwesikhathi; okhiye bemicibisholo bakugcina kuvuliwe ukuze ufunde futhi. Linda ukhiye kugcina kuvuliwe uze ucindezele oyedwa.
set_attachment_dir_note = Lapho u-"Londoloza konke" ubhala khona okunamathiselwe uma umlayezo unokungaphezu kokukodwa. Idalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ingekho. Umlayezo onokunamathiselwe okukodwa usabuza ukuthi uzolondolozwa kuphi, njengakuqala. Shiya ize ukuze kusetshenziswe ezenzakalelayo:\n{path}
set_autosave_note = Ukuthi ithebhu yokubhala evuliwe izilondoloza kangakanani kuma-Drafti ngenkathi ubhala. U-Londoloza idrafti (Ctrl+S) usalondoloza uma kucelwa kuzo zombili izimo, futhi ukuvala ithebhu enombhalo ongalondolozwanga kuhlala kunikeza ukuyilondoloza. Valiwe uvala ukulondoloza okuzenzakalelayo. Okungaphansi kwamasekhondi angu-15 akunikezwa -- lokho kungaba uhambo lweseva oluncintisana nokuthayipha kwakho.
set_auto_purge_note = Kususa unomphela imilayezo kudoti nokuNgafuneki uma isihlale lapho lezi zinsuku -- ukususa unomphela okufanayo okwenziwa u-Ngenisa udoti no-Ngenisa Okungafuneki uma kucelwa, kusebenza ngokuzenzakalelayo kanye ngosuku ngenkathi i-ZBox ivuliwe. Kuvuliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo ezinsukwini ezingu-30. Valiwe uyakuvala. Lokhu akukwazi ukuhlehliswa uma umlayezo usususiwe.
set_bare_keys_note = Uma kuvuliwe, ukucindezela u-S, A, J, W noma u-K kuphela ohlwini lwemilayezo kushintsha inkanyezi, kugcina, kumaka imilayezo ekhethiwe njengokungafuneki (u-Shift+J ukumaka njengokufunekayo), noma kubheka/kuziba intambo okuyingxenye yakho ukukhetha, ngokushesha -- u-Gcina no-Maka njengokungafuneki akunakuqinisekisa futhi akunakuhlehliswa. Ukukuvala kubuyisela u-S, A, J, W no-K ekuhambeni okujwayelekile kohlu ngohlamvu lokuqala. U-Ctrl+S no-Ctrl+Shift+A baqhubeka bekusebenza kuzo zombili izimo. Kusebenza ngokushesha.
set_sounds_note = Amathoni amafushane okuqhubeka, imilayezo emisha, ezithunyelwe, ezaphendulwa noma ezidluliselwa, ukususwa nemiphumela yokusesha. Valiwe uvala wonke umsindo ohlelweni; izimemezelo zomfundi wesikrini nebha yesimo azithinteki kuzo zombili izimo.
set_desktop_notifications_note = Isaziso se-Windows kuqoqo ngalinye leposi elisha, ngokwehlukile emsindweni ongenhla. Valiwe uyakuvala kuwo wonke ama-akhawunti; i-akhawunti eyodwa nayo ingathuliswa yodwa ku-Amasethingi ama-akhawunti nobuwena.
set_theme_note = Izitimu ezenziwe ngokwezifiso yizifolda ezifakwa ngaphakathi kwefolda ye-sounds ye-ZBox, ngayinye inemisindo yayo ye-progress-tick.wav, incoming-message.wav, action-done.wav, delete.wav, searching.wav, searching_done.wav kanye ne-none_found.wav. Ifayela letimu elingekho libuyela emsindweni ozenzakalelayo.
set_theme_note_only_default = Izitimu ezenziwe ngokwezifiso yizifolda ezifakwa ngaphakathi kwefolda ye-sounds ye-ZBox, ngayinye inemisindo yayo ye-progress-tick.wav, incoming-message.wav, action-done.wav, delete.wav, searching.wav, searching_done.wav kanye ne-none_found.wav. Ifayela letimu elingekho libuyela emsindweni ozenzakalelayo. U-"default" kuphela otholakalayo uze wengeze enye ifolda yetimu.
set_lock_note = Ukuqala kwe-ZBox kube sekubuza eyodwa yezindlela zakho zokuvula ngaphambi kokuba kuvulwe noma iyiphi i-akhawunti. Noma iyiphi kwazo ikhona: ukhiye wokungena, ukhiye wokuphepha, noma iphasiwedi enkulu. Ukuvala uye endaweni yezaziso akukona ukuphuma futhi akukhiyi kabusha; U-Ifayela > Phuma nokuthi Phuma kwesithonjana sendawo yezaziso kuyakhiya. Uma kungekho okubhalisiwe futhi iphasiwedi enkulu ingasethiwe, ukhiye uyeqiwa kunokukukhiya ngaphandle kweposi lakho.
set_security_note = Iphasiwedi enkulu iyona yodwa kokuthathu ebethela noma yini: yiyona evumela le folda ukuvula amaphasiwedi ama-akhawunti alondoloziwe kwelinye ikhompyutha. Ukhiye wokungena noma ukhiye wokuphepha uvula uhlelo kuleli kuphela. Akukho okufaka esikhundleni sephasiwedi enkulu kukhompyutha i-ZBox engakaze isetshenziswe kuyo.
set_private_mode_note = Imilayezo ifundwa kuseva futhi igcinwa enkumbulweni kuphela. Awekho amakhophi e-offline, imilayezo elondoloziwe noma amarekhodi okususa amaphutha agcinwayo, futhi okunamathiselwe okuvuliwe nedatha yesiphequluli yeposi le-HTML kuyasuswa uma i-ZBox ivalwa. Ukuvala kuphinda kuqede zonke izinhlelo ezaqalwa yi-ZBox, kuhlanganise nalezo ezikhombisa okunamathiselwe, kukhiphe i-clipboard, futhi kuyeke ukwethemba leli khompyutha ngaphandle uma imodi yangasese ivulwe kulo. I-Windows isagcina amanye amarekhodi ayikho inhlelo engawasusa, njengohlu lwayo lwamadiski e-USB, ifayela lekhasi, namarekhodi e-antivirus nenethiwekhi.
title_private_mode = Imodi yangasese
private_mode_need_master = Imodi yangasese idinga iphasiwedi enkulu, ngoba iphasiwedi enkulu kuphela evula ama-akhawunti akho kukhompyutha engeyona eyakho. Setha eyodwa ngenkinobho ethi Iphasiwedi enkulu, bese uvula imodi yangasese.
private_mode_enter_master = Faka iphasiwedi enkulu ukuvula imodi yangasese.
private_mode_confirm = Imodi yangasese ayigcini amakhophi eposi lakho kuleli khompyutha noma kudiski i-ZBox esebenza kulo. Ukuyivula kususa amakhophi e-offline e-ZBox, imilayezo elondoloziwe, okunamathiselwe okuvuliwe, idatha yesiphequluli yeposi le-HTML namarekhodi okususa amaphutha. Akukho okususwa kuma-seva akho amameyili, futhi ama-akhawunti akho, abathintana nabo namasethingi kugcinwa. Vula imodi yangasese?
set_minimize_note = Ukunciphisa i-ZBox kufihla inkinobho yayo yebha yemisebenzi futhi ikushiya isebenza ngemuva kwesithonjana sendawo yezaziso. Chofoza ngakwesokunxele isithonjana (noma u-Enter/Space uma sinefokhasi yekhibhodi) ukubuyisa iwindi.
set_close_note = Inkinobho Yokuvala yewindi, u-Alt+F4, no-Ctrl+W ocindezelwe kuthebhu Yeposi kufihla i-ZBox endaweni yezaziso esikhundleni sokuphuma. U-Ifayela > Phuma (Ctrl+Shift+Q) nento ethi Phuma yesithonjana sendawo yezaziso kuphuma ku-ZBox ngempela kuzo zombili izimo, ngakho kuhlala kunendlela eyodwa yekhibhodi yokuphuma ngaphandle kokuthinta indawo yezaziso.
set_stay_maximized_note = I-ZBox iqala ikhulisiwe futhi ibuyiselwa ekukhulisweni uma uyincipha. Ibha yemenyu, ibha yesihloko nomphetho wewindi akuthinteki -- lena akuyona imodi yesikrini esigcwele engenamphetho, ngakho zonke izinqamuleli zemenyu ze-Alt ziyaqhubeka zisebenza.
set_run_at_startup_note = Iqalisa i-ZBox ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ungena ku-Windows, ivulwe ngqo endaweni yezaziso esikhundleni sokukhombisa iwindi layo. Kusebenza ngokushesha, hhayi ngokuqala okulandelayo kuphela.
set_desktop_shortcut_note = Ibeka isinqamuleli se-ZBox kudeskithophu yakho, ishintshe esisele lapho. Isinqamuleli sigcina indawo eqondile yale folda ye-ZBox, ngakho uma uthutha noma ukopisha i-ZBox kwenye indawo, cindezela lokhu futhi kukhophi entsha ukuze isinqamuleli sedeskithophu sikhombe kuyo. Kusebenza ngokushesha futhi akulindi u-OK.

