mp_explain_set = Iphasiwedi enkulu isethiwe. Yiyona evumela le folda ye-ZBox ukuvula amaphasiwedi ama-akhawunti ayo alondoloziwe kwelinye ikhompyutha.\n\nShiya womabili amabhokisi ephasiwedi entsha engenalutho bese ucindezela u-OK ukuyisusa. Ukususa akuthinti leli khompyutha, kodwa ifolda ngeke isasebenza kunoma yiliphi elinye ngaphandle kokuba i-akhawunti ngayinye ingene futhi.
mp_explain_unset = Ayikho iphasiwedi enkulu esethiwe, ngakho amaphasiwedi ama-akhawunti alondoloziwe angafundwa kuphela kuleli khompyutha nakule akhawunti ye-Windows. Uma ukopisha ifolda kwenye indawo, i-akhawunti ngayinye kufanele ingene futhi kuseva yayo yamameyili.\n\nSetha eyodwa futhi i-ZBox izoyibuza kanye kukhompyutha ngayinye entsha, bese ivula ngokujwayelekile lapho. Leli khompyutha ngeke libuze futhi.\n\nYibhale phansi futhi uyigcine endaweni ephephile. Ayigcinwandawo futhi ayikwazi ukubuyiswa: uma uyikhohlwa, i-akhawunti ngayinye kufanele ingene futhi kuseva yayo yamameyili.
