set_update_note = I-ZBox ihlola i-GitHub ukuthola ukukhishwa okusha kanye ngosuku ngokuphezulu, uma ingenzi lutho kuphela, futhi ayithumeli lutho ngaphandle kwenombolo yenguqulo yayo. U-Ngibuze ukhombisa inguqulo entsha namanothi ayo okukhishwa, no-Yebo, buyekeza manje no-Ngikhumbuze kamuva. U-Dawuniloda futhi ufake ngokuthula udawunilodela isibuyekezo ngesikhathi esingenzi lutho futhi usifaka ngokuzayo uma uvala i-ZBox ngokuphelele, hhayi ngenkathi usebenza. Isibuyekezo sishintsha kuphela amafayela enhlelo ye-ZBox uqobo: ama-akhawunti akho, amaphasiwedi, amasethingi, iposi, amarekhodi, izitimu zemisindo nanoma yiluphi ulimi olwengeziwe awasoze athintwa, futhi inguqulo yangaphambilini iyagcinwa futhi izibuyisela uma entsha ingaqali. U-Usizo, Izibuyekezo unalo futhi u-Hlola izibuyekezo manje nekhasi lokukhishwa lokubuyekeza ngesandla.
